@startuml state_reservation
[*] --> AVAILABLE
AVAILABLE --> RESERVED : unit claimed
RESERVED --> PAYMENT_PENDING : checkout
PAYMENT_PENDING --> CONFIRMED : authorized (fencing ok)
CONFIRMED --> SOLD : order persisted + captured
RESERVED --> TIMEOUT : expires_at
PAYMENT_PENDING --> PAYMENT_FAILED : declined / voided
TIMEOUT --> RELEASED
PAYMENT_FAILED --> RELEASED
RELEASED --> AVAILABLE : token returned
SOLD --> [*]
@enduml
